OL,3,GNEWSAHomes approved for former
OL,4,Afactory's bowling green
OL,5,
OL,6,FEleven homes are set to be built on a
OL,7,Fformer factory's bowling green after
OL,8,Fplans were given the go-ahead.
OL,10,FThe project is to be developed on land
OL,11,Foff Woden Road, Wolverhampton, which
OL,12,Fwas previously occupied by Gunnebo, a
OL,13,Fmanufacturer of safes.
OL,15,FThe factory was demolished after the
OL,16,Fcompany announced plans to close it in
OL,17,Flate 2000 and much of the wider site
OL,18,Fhas since been redeveloped.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
