OL,3,GNEWSAHomes approved for former
OL,4,Afactory's bowling green
OL,5,
OL,6,FApproving the proposal for the bowling
OL,7,Fgreen component, the city council's
OL,8,Fplanning office said the recreational
OL,9,Fspace was "no longer required" and its
OL,10,Floss was considered acceptable.
